  data: {
    LLM: "Priority: Get rid of Jokers! Because they are 50 points, it is almost never worth holding onto a Joker to complete a long run. Play it as soon as you have a valid set.\n\nThe 'Red Ace' Strategy: If you suspect another player is about to go out, try to hoard Red Aces. They only count as 1 point, allowing you to 'lose' the round with minimal damage.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Pay attention to what cards are being picked up from the discard pile. If you know an opponent needs a 7 of Hearts to go out, keep that 7 in your hand even if it doesn't help your own meld.",
